  "description": "No National Archives description. National Archives shot list card:\nBikini, Atoll (No captions) 1946\nFS, B-29 \"Dave's Dream\" lands on field after bombing. \nVS, Public Relations officer interviews the two pilots, Major Swanscott and Major Wood. \nGen Curtis E LeMay and an unidentified Air Corps Brig Gen also say a few words for the reporter. \nFSs, B-29s taking off at dawn from unidentified airfield. \nShort cut of men in observation tower. \nLMS & CU, group of the men on field watching the takeoff. In the fg an officer broadcasting over a transceiver. \nMLS, planes warming up on airfield. \nVS, men wearing parachutes and other paraphernalia standing around on airstrip. \nLS, group of B-29s flying over the crowd. \nHS, bomb bursts moving up through the clouds. \nNational Archives Identifier: 20945\n\nAs always, any error or typo is mine and if you enjoy my uploads or if you intend to make $ or otherwise profit from these files, please consider making a donation to a veteran's charity of your choice and/or Archive.org itself. Thanks. :)",
