    {
      "s": 250.3,
      "e": 252.88,
      "text": "I'd like to say, the whole crew operator"
    },
    {
      "s": 252.88,
      "e": 254.88,
      "text": "is going nicely on the whole route."
    },
    {
      "s": 254.88,
      "e": 257.32,
      "text": "We couldn't find the driver, whatever."
    },
    {
      "s": 257.32,
      "e": 260.46,
      "text": "So I'm hoping I don't have a high-fowl-coop-coop-coop-coop"
    },
    {
      "s": 260.46,
      "e": 264.06,
      "text": "for a while."
    },
    {
      "s": 264.06,
      "e": 266.02,
      "text": "I wouldn't want to say that I'm pretty sure it's going to be"
    },
    {
      "s": 266.02,
      "e": 268.26,
      "text": "going for a way for me to go."
    }
  ],
